    <div>
      <h2>The vibe</h2>
      <p>Doggy Wash Express is a 100% self-service dog washing station in Nice, on avenue Saint-Barthélémy (note: the official postcode is 06100, not the 06000 you may see on some directories). It runs on an automated terminal with card payment, with no staff on site.</p>

      <h2>What to know before you go</h2>
      <p>The station offers shampoo, conditioner, anti-parasite treatment, and a choice of gentle or strong drying, with products certified by veterinary labs and lukewarm water for the dog's comfort. The station is open 7 days a week from 8am to 8pm. The company was registered on 8 November 2024; this information is cross-checked by the official register data.gouv.fr, Pappers, PagesJaunes, Mappy, local press (ici.fr) and the official Facebook page — a good confidence level. The exact prices, however, could not be found.</p>
      <div class="callout">Coco's tip: a very recent station (registered in late 2024) — check the most recent reviews before going, as the equipment and upkeep may still be evolving.</div>

      <h2>Nearby</h2>
      <p>The Saint-Barthélémy neighbourhood, in the north of Nice, is close to the roads leading into the Nice hinterland.</p>
